{
  "texts": [
    {
      "content": "The Fleur Mstafeli is a medium-sized carnivorous plant\nthat lures its prey with a fragrant, intoxicating fruit.",
      "left": "249.4px",
      "top": "193px",
      "scale": "1",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    },
    {
      "content": "Its bulbous, tooth-lined structure hides among low vegetation,\n camouflaged by symmetrical leaves and twisted roots. ",
      "left": "239.4px",
      "top": "273.4px",
      "scale": "1",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    },
    {
      "content": "Fleur Mstafeli",
      "left": "406.775px",
      "top": "80.4875px",
      "scale": "5.199999999999998",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    },
    {
      "content": "When it senses nearby movement, it strikes with a rapid bite, injecting\n a neurotoxic venom capable of paralyzingeven large organisms.",
      "left": "204px",
      "top": "344px",
      "scale": "1",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    },
    {
      "content": "Once immobilized, the plant drains blood and vital fluids through its\nspined maw, leaving behind dry, skeletal remains that decompose into fertilizer.",
      "left": "170px",
      "top": "415px",
      "scale": "1",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    },
    {
      "content": "Its hunting cycle is silent, efficient, and brutal—making it a near-invisible\n predator for any creature unfamiliar with its feeding pattern.",
      "left": "184px",
      "top": "485px",
      "scale": "1",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    }
  ],
